{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>美國流行音樂女王麥當娜（Madonna）多年來出名形象百變，其中90年代法國時裝怪傑Jean-Paul Gaultier（JPG）為娜姐《Blonde Ambition》世界巡唱設計的 「雪糕筒bra」是經典造型之一。最近美國女星Anya Taylor-Joy就翻玩該造型登雜誌《Dazed》封面。除了Anya之外，張曼玉亦於90年代賀歲片《家有喜事》中模仿過娜姐的「雪糕筒bra」的經典造型來搞笑。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T04:37:49.390579+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":208,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T04:01:01+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T09:17:13.859280+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T04:31:13.593615+00:00","content_hash":"821bac2f6b41514ca9fc08984f2a83954ec060475c1695e014cb7776ed1a5ef1","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-27T04:37:49.390579+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}